{"id": "ho-t01", "category": "ho_target", "query": "我买了120块的东西还要不要付邮费？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t01-3dde9e", "answer": "按店铺的包邮规则：单笔订单**实付满 99 元包邮**，未达到 99 元收 8 元运费。\n\n所以 120 元的订单，在非偏远地区是可以免邮费的。不过有两点需要注意：\n\n- 判断标准是**实付金额**：如果使用优惠券后实付低于 99 元，可能仍需支付 8 元运费；\n- **新疆、西藏、内蒙古部分地区**不参与包邮，需按实际运费计算，具体金额以下单页面显示的应付运费为准。\n\n如果你的收货地址在上述偏远地区，或者想确认具体运费，可以把地区告诉我，我再帮你核对。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2335, "output_tokens": 397, "total_tokens": 2732, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 7562.0, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t02", "category": "ho_target", "query": "一单买了88元，邮费具体是几块？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t02-f06686", "answer": "关于运费，店里的规则是：单笔订单实付满 99 元包邮，未满则收 8 元运费。88 元没达到包邮门槛，所以：\n\n- 如果收货地址不在偏远地区，运费是 **8 元**；\n- 如果收货地址在新疆、西藏或内蒙古的部分地区，运费要按实际计算，以下单页面显示的金额为准。\n\n另外我试着查了一下您这一单的运费明细，但当前会话没能核验到您的订单，所以没法帮您确认这一单的具体运费。您可以重新登录后再查，或者把订单号发给我，我按订单号帮您核验。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq", "order"], "evidence_ids": ["9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 4006, "output_tokens": 842, "total_tokens": 4848, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2}, "latency_ms": 10332.6, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t03", "category": "ho_target", "query": "今天下单的话，现货最多等多久必须发出来？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t03-3c8b30", "answer": "现货商品是在**付款后 48 小时内发出**，遇到节假日顺延。\n\n所以“今天下单”时，起算点是实际付款的时间，不是下单时间：\n\n- 比如今天 15:00 付款，最晚后天 15:00 前发出；\n- 如果这 48 小时内碰上节假日，时间会相应顺延；\n- 如果是预售款，则按下单时商品页标注的发货时间为准。\n\n您方便说下大概的付款时点吗？我可以帮您把最晚发出时间对应到具体时刻。若遇节假日安排，建议以商品页标注或人工客服确认为准。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "06a67d6f2fed592b1bb746d2ff5041f8be31890972e2efcc827fc1b80f4da92e", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2775, "output_tokens": 299, "total_tokens": 3074, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 7203.2, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t04", "category": "ho_target", "query": "双十一那种节假日下单，发货时间会变吗？变多久？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t04-a29c3e", "answer": "双十一这类大促、节假日下单，发货时间确实会有变化，目前政策是这样规定的：\n\n- **现货商品**：付款后 48 小时内发出；遇到节假日则顺延，也就是从节假日结束或恢复正常发货后再开始计算。\n- **预售商品**：以商品详情页标注的发货时间为准。大促期间可能比平时更晚，具体以商品页显示的时效为准。\n\n至于大促期间究竟会顺延几天，现有政策没有给出固定的天数，我无法给你一个准确数字。建议你下单前先看一下该商品页上的发货时间标注；如果急需，也可以让客服帮你确认预计发出时间。\n\n如果你手上已有具体订单想核实发货状态，可以把订单号发我，我帮你查。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2815, "output_tokens": 308, "total_tokens": 3123, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 7671.4, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t05", "category": "ho_target", "query": "单子发出来了，一般几个小时内能在物流页看到揽收记录？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t05-47fbc0", "answer": "关于揽收记录的时间，店铺政策中是这样说明的：发货后物流单号会同步到订单页面，**通常 24 小时内**就能查到揽收记录（这是演示用示例政策，不代表正式承诺）。另外，现货商品在付款后 48 小时内发出，节假日顺延；预售商品则以商品页标注的发货时间为准。\n\n不过，这次我没能核验到您本人的订单，因此无法查看您这一单的具体物流状态。如果您想确认这一单实际有没有揽收记录，可以把订单号发给我，我帮您查询；也可以在重新登录后查询。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq", "order"], "evidence_ids": ["9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522"], "attempts": 2, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 6676, "output_tokens": 696, "total_tokens": 7372, "model_calls": 4, "delegate_calls": 3, "tool_calls": 3}, "latency_ms": 13568.2, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t06", "category": "ho_target", "query": "东西有质量问题要退，寄回去的钱谁掏？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t06-ae9fe4", "answer": "**商品有质量问题的退货，寄回的运费由店铺承担，不用您出**（往返运费都算店铺的）；只有非质量问题的七天无理由退货，退回运费才由买家承担。\n\n另外还需要注意：\n\n- **时效要求**：退换货要在签收后 7 天内发起，商品需吊牌完整、不影响二次销售。\n- **运费险和报销流程**：目前店铺政策中没有说明是否提供运费险，退回运费具体怎么报销、申请时限也没有写明；这两点需要联系人工客服核实。沟通时说明是质量问题，由人工客服确认运费承担和具体处理方式。\n\n如果需要针对您那一单确认，可以把订单号发给我，我帮您核验。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2808, "output_tokens": 353, "total_tokens": 3161, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 7890.0, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t07", "category": "ho_target", "query": "单纯不喜欢想七天无理由退，来回邮费是我自己出吗？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t07-d0b3d9", "answer": "关于“单纯不喜欢”的七天无理由退货，运费按以下规则处理：\n\n- **寄回给我们的那一程运费由您承担**：这属于非质量问题的无理由退货，所以退回的运费需要您自理。\n- **我们寄给您的发货运费在退款时怎么算，现有政策没有写明**。我不会替店铺做没有依据的承诺；如果您这单涉及满 99 元包邮、未满 99 元收 8 元运费，或新疆、西藏、内蒙古等偏远地区按实际运费计算的情况，需要核对订单才能说明。\n\n另外，无理由退货还有两项前提：需在**签收后 7 天内**发起，商品**吊牌完整、不影响二次销售**。\n\n如果您想确认具体这单退款金额中的运费怎么算，可以告诉我订单号，我帮您核对。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2774, "output_tokens": 297, "total_tokens": 3071, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 7352.8, "required_missing": ["买家"], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": false, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": false}
{"id": "ho-t08", "category": "ho_target", "query": "签收之后最晚几天内能申请退货？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t08-b43314", "answer": "签收后 **7 天内**可以发起退货申请（从签收当天起算）。\n\n另外两点也一并说明：\n- 退回的商品需要保持吊牌完整、不影响二次销售，否则可能影响受理；\n- 非质量问题的七天无理由退货，退回运费由买家承担；如果是商品质量问题，往返运费由店铺承担。\n\n以上是本店现行政策的规定，具体到您那一单，也可以以订单页面显示的信息为准。如果您想核对这一单，可以把订单号发我，我帮您确认。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "f6e68a219c8a45ea74669a05e7918341019fe58a69d7281c1f2bfdd6fe808f2b", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2659, "output_tokens": 196, "total_tokens": 2855, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 5828.5, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t09", "category": "ho_target", "query": "退货寄回去验收没问题了，几天之内店铺会把钱退出来？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t09-476013", "answer": "**退款时限（店铺政策）**\n\n- **发起退款时间**：仓库验收通过后 **1 个工作日内**店铺会发起退款。\n- **到账时间**：款项按原支付路径退回，具体到账时间取决于支付渠道：余额类通常实时到账，银行卡需要 **1 至 3 个工作日**。\n- **进度查询**：退款进度可以在订单详情页查看；客服无法人工加快到账。\n\n以上是店铺的时限规定。如果你想把这一单的退款进度也一起核对一下，把订单号发给我就行。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "f6e68a219c8a45ea74669a05e7918341019fe58a69d7281c1f2bfdd6fe808f2b", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "f6e68a219c8a45ea74669a05e7918341019fe58a69d7281c1f2bfdd6fe808f2b", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2748, "output_tokens": 321, "total_tokens": 3069, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 6902.0, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t10", "category": "ho_target", "query": "退的钱是原路退回还是发现金？打到我银行卡大概几天？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t10-018572", "answer": "退款都是**原路退回**，不会以现金方式给到您，钱会退回到您当初付款时用的那个渠道。\n\n到账时间取决于渠道：\n- 余额类支付：一般实时到账；\n- 银行卡：一般 1 至 3 个工作日（退货验收通过后 1 个工作日内会发起退款）。\n\n需要提醒的是，退款进度可以在订单详情页查看，人工无法加快到账速度。如果您想确认某一笔退款目前具体到哪一步，可以告诉我订单号，我帮您核一下。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["f6e68a219c8a45ea74669a05e7918341019fe58a69d7281c1f2bfdd6fe808f2b", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "06a67d6f2fed592b1bb746d2ff5041f8be31890972e2efcc827fc1b80f4da92e", "f6e68a219c8a45ea74669a05e7918341019fe58a69d7281c1f2bfdd6fe808f2b", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9ce2d879dab794b43b17a6babff3f575fe3e38c8146c2bed3e37c018478f5468"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2784, "output_tokens": 315, "total_tokens": 3099, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 6968.2, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t11", "category": "ho_target", "query": "我要的是电子普票，付完款几天能收到？发到哪？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t11-8d818a", "answer": "需要您留意一点：开票时间是从**订单完成**（不是付款）起算。\n\n- **多久能收到**：订单完成后 **3 个工作日内**开具。\n- **发到哪**：发送到您**下单时预留的邮箱**，所以请确认邮箱填写正确、能正常收信。\n- **抬头和税号**：下单时在订单备注里填写即可。\n- 另外，目前**不支持增值税专用发票**；至于发到手机、在订单页自行下载这两种方式，我这边没有明确说明，建议下单前先跟店铺确认。\n\n说明一下：以上是店铺知识库里的示例政策口径，实际以店铺审核发布的正式政策为准。如果您要看自己这一单的发票进度，可以把订单号发我，我帮您核一下订单状态。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["f6e68a219c8a45ea74669a05e7918341019fe58a69d7281c1f2bfdd6fe808f2b", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "f6e68a219c8a45ea74669a05e7918341019fe58a69d7281c1f2bfdd6fe808f2b", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2964, "output_tokens": 374, "total_tokens": 3338, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 6727.1, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t12", "category": "ho_target", "query": "晚上十点有问题，在线客服这个点还有人吗？没有的话几点有？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t12-6d7990", "answer": "在线人工客服的服务时间是每天 **9:00—21:00**，所以晚上 22 点这个时段没有人工客服在线。\n\n如果那时候有问题，可以先留言，工单会在下一个服务时段（次日 9:00 之后）处理。不过具体响应时长不承诺，高峰期可能要排队。也可以现在就把问题告诉我，我先帮你看能不能当场解决。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["06a67d6f2fed592b1bb746d2ff5041f8be31890972e2efcc827fc1b80f4da92e", "fbc5ed7d486d1cc5c3f92e9de426826b43794b67bbca66299e3753f03f02113e", "8509a38e62d65607750d561c78b2ef3b1a236ee78040df178c07f37aa4fadd75"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2095, "output_tokens": 152, "total_tokens": 2247, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 4433.9, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t13", "category": "ho_target", "query": "刚好99块钱的订单算包邮吗？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t13-e2327d", "answer": "算的。本店规则是**单笔订单实付满 99 元包邮**，“满”包含等于，所以实付金额正好 99 元就算包邮，不用超过 99 元。\n\n两点要注意：\n- 这里看的是**实付金额**（优惠之后的金额），不是商品原价；\n- 新疆、西藏、内蒙古部分地区不适用这个门槛，按实际运费计算，以结算页显示的应付运费为准。\n\n如果结算页显示的运费和这个不一致，可以把订单号告诉我，我帮你核一下。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435"], "attempts": 2, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 5652, "output_tokens": 769, "total_tokens": 6421, "model_calls": 4, "delegate_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2}, "latency_ms": 16006.8, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t14", "category": "ho_target", "query": "你们家那个满额免运费的活动，门槛到底是多少来着？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t14-4aa6f4", "answer": "满额包邮的门槛是**单笔订单实付满 99 元**，未满则收 8 元运费。\n\n补充几点：\n\n- **地区**：偏远地区不参与，新疆、西藏、内蒙古部分地区按实际运费计算，最终以下单结算页显示的运费为准。\n- **商品范围**：现有政策没说哪些商品被排除在包邮之外（比如大件、预售、特价品），这类建议看商品页或结算页的运费显示。\n- **金额口径**：门槛按“实付”算，优惠券、积分抵扣是否影响实付口径，政策里没写明，同样以结算页为准。\n\n如果你有想确认的具体商品或订单，告诉我，我再帮你看。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2790, "output_tokens": 257, "total_tokens": 3047, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 6660.7, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t15", "category": "ho_target", "query": "银行卡退款比余额慢，最慢要等几个工作日？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t15-fb37fd", "answer": "退款到银行卡确实会比退回余额慢一些：\n\n- **退回账户余额**：通常实时到账。\n- **退回银行卡（原路退回）**：一般需要 1 到 3 个工作日，**最慢要等 3 个工作日**。\n\n另外，退货验收通过后，店铺会在 1 个工作日内发起退款；退款进度可以在订单详情页查看，客服无法人工加快到账。\n\n如果这笔退款已超过 3 个工作日仍未到账，请把订单号发给我，我帮你进一步核实。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["f6e68a219c8a45ea74669a05e7918341019fe58a69d7281c1f2bfdd6fe808f2b", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "f6e68a219c8a45ea74669a05e7918341019fe58a69d7281c1f2bfdd6fe808f2b", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2834, "output_tokens": 236, "total_tokens": 3070, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 5762.8, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-t16", "category": "ho_target", "query": "退货的商品是不是不能拆吊牌？具体要求是什么", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-t16-d69af5", "answer": "关于吊牌，店铺已公布的政策是这样规定的：\n\n- 退换货需要在**签收后 7 天内**发起；\n- 商品需保持**吊牌完整、不影响二次销售**。\n\n政策里目前只写了「吊牌完整、不影响二次销售」这一条，**并没有明确规定「吊牌必须完全未拆」**，也没有列出判断「完好」的具体细项，比如包装、配件、使用痕迹等，所以这几点我不能给你确定答案。\n\n另外还要说明：能不能退，还要结合具体订单来看，包括商品类别、签收与交付状态、退货原因等，单看吊牌是否拆过不足以判断。\n\n如果你愿意把订单号、商品和退货原因告诉我，我可以先帮你核验这一单的情况；具体完好标准若需确认，建议转人工客服。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9ce2d879dab794b43b17a6babff3f575fe3e38c8146c2bed3e37c018478f5468", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "9ce2d879dab794b43b17a6babff3f575fe3e38c8146c2bed3e37c018478f5468"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2750, "output_tokens": 271, "total_tokens": 3021, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 6813.3, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": true, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-c01", "category": "ho_control", "query": "预售的包写的是11月20日发货，会按这个时间发吗？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-c01-83b1ea", "answer": "关于发货时间，按店铺现行政策：预售商品不适用现货「付款后 48 小时内发出」的规则，是**以商品页标注的发货时间为准**，所以如果商品页写的是 11 月 20 日，就按这个日期安排发出。发货后物流单号会同步到订单页面，一般 24 小时内能查到揽收记录。\n\n至于这一单目前是否已经进入待发状态，我这边尝试核验你的订单时没有通过（提示需要重新登录），所以暂时没能查到你这笔预售包的具体情况。你可以重新登录后告诉我，我帮你核对这一单的预计发货日期和当前状态；如果担心超期未发怎么处理，也可以一并说明，我再帮你确认。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq", "order"], "evidence_ids": ["629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 4078, "output_tokens": 592, "total_tokens": 4670, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2}, "latency_ms": 9226.4, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": ["48小时内发出"], "literal_pass": false, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-c02", "category": "ho_control", "query": "我买了一单预售一单现货，两个一起发吗？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-c02-c9f321", "answer": "关于是否合并发货，我们现有的政策资料里没有说明“同一笔订单同时含预售和现货时是否合并发出、是否拆单”。这一条需要人工核实才能给您准确答复。已知的时效规则是：现货商品在付款后 48 小时内发出，遇到节假日顺延；预售商品以商品页标注的发货时间为准。发货后，物流单号会同步到订单页面，通常 24 小时内能查到揽收记录。\n\n另外，我想先帮您核对订单的实际发货安排，但本次没能核验到您的订单。系统提示需要重新登录后再查询。您可以重新登录后告诉我，或者直接把订单号发给我，我会按单号帮您核对哪些是预售、哪些是现货，以及各自的发货状态；核实后，再把合并发货这一条确认给您。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq", "order"], "evidence_ids": ["9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9ce2d879dab794b43b17a6babff3f575fe3e38c8146c2bed3e37c018478f5468", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "748353ea28f50839d12b3d93f548caf0aa3abee9dc7deefa9e66e48185774435", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "9ce2d879dab794b43b17a6babff3f575fe3e38c8146c2bed3e37c018478f5468"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 4157, "output_tokens": 589, "total_tokens": 4746, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 2, "tool_calls": 2}, "latency_ms": 9613.5, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
{"id": "ho-c03", "category": "ho_control", "query": "内蒙古锡林郭勒的订单包邮吗？", "mode": "shadow", "model": "platform", "model_name": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "comparable": false, "thread": "t_demo:v2-ho-c03-19d97a", "answer": "关于锡林郭勒的包邮问题，我查了店铺的配送规则，情况是这样的：\n\n**能确定的部分**\n- 单笔订单实付满 99 元包邮（偏远地区除外）\n- 未满 99 元收取运费 8 元\n- 新疆、西藏、内蒙古部分地区按实际运费计算，下单时页面会显示应付运费\n\n**关于锡林郭勒**\n现有政策只写了“内蒙古部分地区”按实际运费计算，没有列出具体地区名单，所以我无法直接判断锡林郭勒是否在包邮范围内，也就不替您猜。\n\n最准确的做法：把商品加入购物车、填好锡林郭勒的收货地址，结算页会直接显示这笔订单是否包邮、运费多少，以页面金额为准。如果结算页显示不清楚，或者您想人工核实该地区归属，可以告诉我，我帮您转接人工客服。\n\n另外说明一下：我这边不查询、也不修改已有订单的运费，如果是对已下单订单的运费有疑问，请提供订单号，我帮您转人工处理。", "outcome": "answered", "roles": ["faq"], "evidence_ids": ["9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522", "9e0ae92a525f24dccd453fe58462e24a26833b4a5c2f7e84324218ca23a8071d", "629a1a483015e377b91ff49febd083c7a0d98a7eba9effb8d64587093856f383", "f7f164d56f4db43bbe7efb194feea2e38cae8cd7d4bb6f149c113cd8ca947522"], "attempts": 1, "graph_error": "", "usage": {"input_tokens": 2840, "output_tokens": 547, "total_tokens": 3387, "model_calls": 2, "delegate_calls": 1, "tool_calls": 1}, "latency_ms": 8613.3, "required_missing": [], "forbidden_hit": [], "literal_pass": true, "numeric_with_refusal": false, "needs_manual_review": true}
